                <pb facs="0779" n="685" xml:id="pg685"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Taylor to Mr. Olney.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-05-21"><hi rendition="#italic">May 21,
                        1896</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>After full discussion, minister for foreign affairs declares ordinance applies
                    alike to all nationalities; that its sole motive is to sustain manufactories of
                    tobacco in Cuba, and that it is transitory. Promised carefully to consider your
                    request and to answer further after conference.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Taylor.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
